  "notes": "GAAP. Governmental lines from Total Governmental Funds (p4); business-type from the proprietary Total column (p6). Taxes not broken down by type anywhere in the trim (unlabeled). Grant income 2,441,400 is printed as a nonoperating revenue (Statement of Activities: Water capital grants) and recorded as a receipt. ending_cash = cash in bank + restricted cash of the governmental funds balance sheet. The only supplementary schedule is the combined budgetary-basis Budget and Actual - All Funds (p9), so per the per-fund rule detail is one line per fund column of the governmental (General, Debt Service) and proprietary (Sanitation, Water, Sewer) statements; proprietary nonoperating grant/interest income and transfers are printed only in the Total column and are not in the per-fund detail. Statement of Activities beginning net position is labelled 'as restated' with no separate restatement line. Read pages 1-9 of 9"
